 <h3><u>Sajjad zara ahista</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye haye<br> Aijaz e Imamat se SAJJAD chale aaye</p> 
  <p>KARBALA, KARBALA<br> Aur Ganj e Shaheeda me begoro kafan laashe, SAJJAD ne dekhe<br> SHABBIR&nbsp; ke maqtal me, SAJJAD juhi pohonche<br> Awaaz yeh aati thi, SHABBIR ke laashe se</p> 
  <p>Aao aye beta, do hume pursa, in shaheedon ka</p> 
  <p>Dafn karne mujhe tu aaya hai<br> Dhyaan rakhna magar mere laal<br> Main hu zakhmi badan, pehnana kafan</p> 
  <p>(SAJJAD zara ahista) ..(2)<br> Main hu zakhmi badan<br> (SAJJAD zara ahista) ..(2)</p> 
  <p>(1) (Aye khudawand e gham) ..(2)<br> Tujhpe khud bhi masaeb ka saaya hai<br> Tera ehsaan hai bekafan ko kafan dene aaya hai<br> Mera tashna dahan, pehnana kafan</p> 
  <p>(SAJJAD zara ahista) ..(2)<br> Main hu zakhmi badan<br> SAJJAD zara ahista</p> 
  <p>(2) (Tu akela hain aur) ..(2)<br> Dafn karne ko laashein bahattar hai<br> Khaaq par sabke tan hai magar sar sabhi ke sina par hain<br> Aye sabhi khastatan, pehnana kafan</p> 
  <p>(SAJJAD zara ahista) ..(2)<br> Main hu zakhmi badan<br> SAJJAD zara ahista</p> 
  <p>(3) (Dafn karna pisar) ..(2)<br> Humshabihe PAYAMBAR ka tum lasha<br> dhyaan rakhna magar, zakhmi seena hai us jaan e madar ka<br> Ho na koi dukhan, pehnana kafan</p> 
  <p>(SAJJAD zara ahista) ..(2)<br> Main hu zakhmi badan<br> SAJJAD zara ahista</p> 
  <p>(3) (Sabke lashe tujhe) ..(2)<br> Mil hi jayenge maqtal me aye qaidi<br> Dhundhna dasht me ek gathri me hai laash QASIM ki<br> Hain woh IBN E HASAN, pehnana kafan</p> 
  <p>(SAJJAD zara ahista) ..(2)<br> Main hu zakhmi badan<br> SAJJAD zara ahista</p> 
  <p>(4)(Lashe ABBAS ko) ..(2)<br> Baad me uske marqad me le jana<br> Dono baazu juda hain, unhe dhundhkar pehle le aana<br> Woh hain saqqa e mann, pehnana kafan</p> 
  <p>(SAJJAD zara ahista) ..(2)<br> Main hu zakhmi badan<br> SAJJAD zara ahista</p> 
  <p>(5) (Lene jao jo tum) ..(2)<br> Neher se laashe AUN O MOHAMMAD ke<br> Maa to royi nahi, inke laashe pe tum rona Shehzaade<br> Dono hai gulbadan, pehnana kafan</p> 
  <p>(SAJJAD zara ahista) ..(2)<br> Main hu zakhmi badan<br> SAJJAD zara ahista</p> 
  <p>(6) (Saari fauj e KHUDA) ..(2)<br> Bekafan so rahi hai isi ban me<br> Shauzab o Jaun o Hurr hai, Habib aur GHAZI ke bete hai<br> Sab hai tashna dahan, pehnana kafan</p> 
  <p>(SAJJAD zara ahista) ..(2)<br> Main hu zakhmi badan<br> SAJJAD zara ahista</p> 
  <p>(7) (Shaam e ghurbat bhi hain) ..(2)<br> Yaad bazaar o zindaan hai tujhko<br> Mazhar e ranj o gham, mere gham ka to Irfan hai tujhko<br> Main hu zakhmi badan, pehnana kafan</p> 
  <p>(SAJJAD zara ahista) ..(2)<br> Main hu zakhmi badan<br> SAJJAD zara ahista</p> 
